This product depends on and is designed to run on top of the "codexbar"
engine by Peter Steinberger, used as an external command-line binary across
a JSON boundary:

    CodexBar — https://github.com/steipete/CodexBar
    Licensed under the MIT License. Copyright (c) 2026 Peter Steinberger.

Need More Tokens does not bundle or link CodexBar source code. It invokes the
separately-installed `codexbar` CLI and consumes its documented JSON output.
The widget snapshot / App Group sharing architecture in this project was
informed by CodexBar's design (MIT), re-implemented independently here.

Provider usage and cost data originate from each provider's own systems
(Anthropic, OpenAI, Google) as surfaced by the codexbar engine; Need More
Tokens reads that data locally and never transmits it anywhere.
